 "chapter": {
  "number": 146,
  "introduction": "The psalmist praises God, and exhorts all to trust in him alone, ver. 1-5. Because of his power, faithfulness and everlasting kingdom, ver. 6-10.",
  "content": [
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 4,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "That day - As soon as ever he is dead. Thoughts - All his designs and endeavours either for himself or for others."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 6,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "For ever - Both because he liveth for ever to fulfil his promises, and because he is eternally faithful."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
